\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Rejection and cancellation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Rejecting a pending order must not deduct stock.\
If an accepted order is cancelled before fulfilment, restore its previously deducted inventory through an atomic, audited operation, subject to the cancellation policy.\
Do not restore stock twice if the cancellation request is retried.\
Do not automatically restore stock when a delivered order is edited.\
A returned product must be restocked through a separate authorized operation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
