\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 wo important business safeguards\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 1. Online payment before stock acceptance: Since you want stock deducted only when an admin accepts an order, a customer might pay successfully while another accepted order consumes the remaining stock. The prompt requires this to be detected and escalated for a refund instead of silently accepting an unfulfillable order. A later improvement would be to reserve stock temporarily during checkout while deducting physical inventory only upon acceptance.\
2. Payment verification must happen on the backend: A success message on an Android screen is not proof that money was received. Razorpay verification and webhook reconciliation must run through trusted server-side code, with duplicate-event protection.\
With these requirements, Claude Code has a clear implementation target for the customer app, dual-admin workflow, payment integration, and inventory system without relying on Vercel to host the Android application.}